urtailed to maintain a safe and inclusive environment. Governments must strike a balance between protecting citizens from harm and preserving their right to freedom of speech. Education on digital literacy and critical thinking is essential to empower individuals to navigate the online world responsibly. Upholding freedom of speech in the online world encourages open dialogue, fosters diverse perspectives, and promotes democratic values.", "encoded_message": "Liberty of voicing is a essential privilege that spreads to the internet-based realm. The cyberspace has emerged as a pivotal stage for citizens to convey their beliefs and ideas unreservedly. However, with this free will entails accountability. Virtual forums should guarantee that abusive rhetoric, cyberintimidation, and falsehoods are restrained to preserve a risk-free and all-embracing surroundings. State bodies must achieve a balance between protecting citizens from harm and preserving their right to freedom of speech. Education on digital literacy and critical thinking is essential to empower individuals to navigate the online world responsibly. Upholding freedom of speech in the online world encourages open dialogue, fosters diverse perspectives, and promotes democratic values.", "encoding_time_report": {"container_generation": 6.66, "secret_key_generation": 114.35}, "decoding_time": 0.0003719329833984375, "decoded_message": "0011010010001001111001100100010101000110000100110011000110101110", "error_message": ""}